				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Experimental "Who Am I?" Game.
<br />

<br />
I am not sure that I post enough to be the one that runs it, but I will start it.
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-size: 18px; line-height: normal"><span style="color: darkred">Rules:</span></span>
<br />

<br />
1.  You can only ask questions that can be answered with a simple "yes" or "no" response.
<br />
2.  You cannot ask two questions in a row.
<br />
3.  You must have asked a question in order to make a guess, at "Who Am I?"
<br />
4.  When you ask a question, you earn a guess, when you make a guess you use your guess.  I will keep track of that in the answers.
<br />
5.  More than 1 person at a time may ask questions before I get back here to check.
<br />
6.  The person/character/animal will be of a reasonable notoriety, in my mind anyway.
<br />
7.  Any suggestions/comments/questions about rules are acceptable, and they may be ammended for further games.
<br />

<br />

<br />
